                      <items count="6">
                        <item name="Description" type_name="gh_string" type_code="10">The impulse response against time, for Plot 2D or a panel: the W channel of an ambisonic response, both ears (left, right) of a binaural one. Right-click it to choose the scale: dB (default), the level re the peak floored 100 dB below it, the whole response; or linear, the amplitude: it ends 5 % after the Schroeder curve falls 60 dB, below which the amplitude is invisible. The parameters and the frequency output use the whole response.</item>
